{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0F17", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\text{Cov}(\\mathcal{C}) \\supset \\text{Cov}'(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0005": "$\\text{Cov}(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0006": "$\\tau'$", "MATH_0007": "$\\text{Cov}'(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0009": "$$\n\\epsilon : \\mathcal{C}_\\tau \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{C}_{\\tau'}\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$\\epsilon_*$", "MATH_0011": "$\\epsilon^{-1}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0013": "$\\tau'$", "MATH_0014": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0015": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0017": "$\\tau'$", "MATH_0018": "$\\epsilon$", "MATH_0019": "$$\n\\epsilon :\n(\\mathcal{C}_\\tau, \\mathcal{O}_\\tau)\n\\longrightarrow\n(\\mathcal{C}_{\\tau'}, \\mathcal{O}_{\\tau'})\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-compare}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:defd926c49e036b0839b513ebfb4055ed2f0673b2d7d50290a274755e60b64f5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7a42ae09b7394e8f2434dcd02293f9348621da259e07b956ca49b98fb8801153", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a category. Let\n<MATH_0002>\nbe two ways to endow <MATH_0003> with the structure of a site.\nDenote <MATH_0004> the topology corresponding to <MATH_0005>\nand <MATH_0006> the topology corresponding to <MATH_0007>.\nThen the identity functor on <MATH_0008> defines a morphism\nof sites\n<MATH_0009>\nwhere <MATH_0010> is the identity functor on underlying presheaves and\nwhere <MATH_0011> is the <MATH_0012>-sheafification of a <MATH_0013>-sheaf\n(hence clearly exact). Let <MATH_0014> be a sheaf of rings for the\n<MATH_0015>-topology. Then <MATH_0016> is also a sheaf for the <MATH_0017>-topology\nand <MATH_0018> becomes a morphism of ringed sites\n<MATH_0019>\nFor more discussion, see Section <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:75ca6fc8ae3e18da308cf8bf1af4f150d39abe791b46121d290c66125e2bf301", "unit_id": "tag:0F17:prose-0001"}
